{"unit_id":"dougen__dsh-deepseek-usage#feature-1","repo":"dougen/dsh-deepseek-usage","commit":"87c7e2d30b2a5ea6024e0dff2a10362f50b94813","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-deepseek-usage 的功能「余额与订阅用量」：侧边栏根据当前模型的提供商显示账户余额，或按接口返回的窗口展示订阅剩余额度；点击卡片可立即刷新。 通过侧边栏卡片或设置页操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:707","lib/client.js:562"]}
